SUMMARY:Transcending the Non-Profit Complex: Lessons from
  Indigenous-Palestinian Worldbuilding - by FoodShare Toronto
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/DZF4efCjTN1\n\nHosted by
  FoodShare Toronto (https://foodshare.net/)\n\nThis workshop invites food
  security and anti-poverty workers to critically unpack the NGO-industrial
  complex through Indigenous and Palestinian worldviews\, examining how
  colonial systems shape our relationships\, organising practices\, and
  ultimately the scope of our political imagination.
END:VEVENT
