SUMMARY:Climate Solutions Innovation Forum - by Sustainability Network
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.sustainabilitynetwork.ca/events/weaving-the-basket-how-the-ra
 d-network-emerged-at-the-intersection-of-indigenous-leadership-climate-act
 ion-and-relational-governance\n\nHosted by Sustainability Network
  (https://www.sustainabilitynetwork.ca)\n\nThe RAD Network is an
  Indigenous-led national network that emerged through cultivating the
  “social soil” through relationship building\, ceremony\, and the
  willingness to stay in "not knowing" long enough for something new to
  emerge. This session tells the story of how the RAD Network came into
  being\, and what that story might offer to the broader ENGO community.
END:VEVENT
